This works great. The only changes I made above to @echasnovski's snippet above was to use the new option he made and to force an exact match as the fuzzy match is not as useful when order is preserved, so I changed these lines:
MiniPick.registry.buffer_lines_current = function()
  MiniExtra.pickers.buf_lines({ scope = 'current' }, { source = { show = show_cur_buf_lines } })
end
to these lines:
MiniPick.registry.buffer_lines_current = function()
  MiniExtra.pickers.buf_lines({ scope = "current", preserve_order = true }, {
    source = {
      match = function(stritems, inds, query, opts)
        table.insert(query, 1, "'")
        return MiniPick.default_match(stritems, inds, query, opts)
      end,
      show = show_cur_buf_lines,
    },
  })
end
Now, I'm going to change my <leader>/ binding to this new picker instead of my old binding Pick buf_lines scope='current'. Very excited!
